{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "b94e28b44711b845b848811c3913386ea2406e57b5639acdf7ebf60fcfdb231e", "ja": "臆病な私だから", "zh": "正因为我是个胆小鬼", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "1b83f760b7e8b1963801b072ab6458afd55c8c61418264a74fb49456729d0fda", "ja": "本番当日、雨で撮影は一時中断。緊張が\n膨らみ、自信も気も失う可憐。怖くても\n逃げずに立ち向かうその姿に、みんなは\n勇気をもらっているとプロデューサーに\n励まされ、可憐は一歩を踏み出す。", "zh": "正式拍摄当天，因下雨拍摄一度中断。紧张感不断膨胀，连自信和勇气都逐渐失去的可怜。制作人鼓励她说，大家都从她即使害怕也不逃避、勇敢面对的身影中获得了勇气，于是可怜迈出了第一步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "8b444bafc68f25659e0fe320c39e2d36bb20fec3d49c513abdf3aad9b9d42394", "ja": "CM撮影当日……", "zh": "广告拍摄当天……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1001_401pro", "source_sha256": "7bebbc08acd9f5efadb566839cc2d920fda859454cc1a2d8c6b6e8ecd379bacf", "ja": "急な雨とは、まいったな……。\n撮影も一時中断で、時間も押しちゃうし……。", "zh": "突然下起雨来，真是伤脑筋啊……\n拍摄也暂停了，时间也被耽误了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1002_045kar", "source_sha256": "4659d0ae62d73d4bf6278db0d40644669e794d310249a7cc446a4b5e7a622031", "ja": "じ、時間がなくなると、撮り直しもできませんよね……\n失敗、しないようにしなくちゃ……。", "zh": "要、要是没时间了，就连重拍也做不到了吧……\n得、得注意不能失败……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "5ec17761fabba5c3c31bff44d51fe9d56fa40eb003700ceae0587cad3d71fb4e", "ja": "次のシーン、私が一番手だし……。\nお、落ち着いて……、落ち着いて……！", "zh": "下一场戏由我第一个上场……  \n冷、冷静……冷静……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "1abc2d8105a0db46e135c6bf144e6a4a82e4882f255354aa08d2b9b41c956ba0", "ja": "きゅ～……。", "zh": "呜～～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "ad45c074a3ae4fb02023bff9754219f3c76b34f5b05685c94b430c03a01615f4", "ja": "うわっ、可憐しっかり！　そうだ、アロマを焚けば\n多少は……ええと、どれがいいんだ！？", "zh": "哇，可怜，振作点！对了，要是点上香薰，多少能……呃，哪个好啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "39fe6833aadd0428ad232448f4be227f413014de47db77d34ec378482f0485b6", "ja": "ふぅ……。あ、ありがとうございます、\nプロデューサーさん……。", "zh": "呼……谢谢您，制作人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1007_401pro", "source_sha256": "60fa975405f97c62cde9ae44d6b0e61374ae92b19657149afe40ae4fa6f7f248", "ja": "ふぅ……。\n落ち着いたみたいでよかったよ。", "zh": "呼……。\n看起来总算平静下来了，真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "1f47c050741a751b21d45061d31862dac9f244c22e8555427384484bbbaa226d", "ja": "す、すみません……落ち着かなくちゃって思ったら、\n余計に、緊張しちゃって……。", "zh": "对、对不起……一想到必须冷静下来，反而变得更紧张了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "8ed287b9af5034ef3e47dc4ede9d827bb2b007e7893d69ebb6d1ec6149e5bacf", "ja": "な、情けないですよね……。自分を変えたくて、\nアイドルになるって、決めたのに……。", "zh": "真、真丢人啊……明明是为了改变自己，才决定成为偶像的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1010_045kar", "source_sha256": "3cb879a47bed5451e2898b52e93ef2d6cc9f353a11152a35e0fbd5a764f14f98", "ja": "その、大事なアイドルのお仕事なのに……。\n気絶、しそうになって……。", "zh": "明明是那么重要的偶像工作……我却差点晕过去……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1011_401pro", "source_sha256": "185f547c8dde02da79abba11dda8988cbd550b22c46d2f9ded6d8c0f7808bd46", "ja": "……。\n勇気があるんだな、可憐は。", "zh": "……\n可怜很有勇气呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "6d77a985c4e4c2bbb75c674c6348953fe785b1a28aedc5b0181a196e9b4e3098", "ja": "……え？　い、いえ、臆病だから、こんなことに……\nゆ、勇気とは、正反対で……。", "zh": "……诶？没、没有，正因为我胆小，才会变成这样……\n和、和勇敢，完全是相反的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1013_401pro", "source_sha256": "fe7a7281354ec3a3a3f69f1e1f060d7a5522fe4d8a77a00d2199ed5ced557245", "ja": "緊張するなら、一番手は代わってもらうこともできた。\nみんなも、頼めば引き受けてくれたと思う。", "zh": "如果你紧张的话，也可以让别人代替你第一个上场。大家只要你开口，应该也都会答应的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1014_401pro", "source_sha256": "2ed2dcd7d9a0cba896409295ed2a3351f3fe83a4459ea228d5a40f6b1ee78e7f", "ja": "でも、可憐は何も言わなかったじゃないか。\n必死に、自分で乗り越えようとして。", "zh": "可是，可怜你不是一直什么都没说吗？\n还拼命想靠自己克服。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "a1fb197cf0d62578ea9d56662ce945bb5988e7ec24fbc937db7f820b37be18f5", "ja": "そ、それは……。\nに、逃げちゃったら、お、同じだから……。", "zh": "那、那是因为……  \n要、要是逃跑了，就、就没有区别了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1016_401pro", "source_sha256": "8742037232fa8dfcaa832ff0fb0d2a577d81d14c19bede8d21e49694007a8d90", "ja": "デビューバトルも、そうやって戦い抜いてくれたよな。\n怖くても、逃げないで。", "zh": "出道战时，你也是那样坚持战斗到底的吧。\n就算害怕，也不要逃避。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1017_401pro", "source_sha256": "cf5013ed83594634f4191c93f962414face72c26ec56e6473f8f4c70405aa5a4", "ja": "可憐のそういう、挑戦する勇気……。\nTeam2ndのみんなも、もらってるんじゃないかな。", "zh": "可怜的这种勇于挑战的勇气……\n我想Team2nd的大家也一定从中获得了力量吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "434c5da5ee89b277b9d3416cd15090b15adee70a5339e80aab3c0c5941fa2809", "ja": "わ、私の、勇気を？　みんなが……。", "zh": "我、我的勇气？大家都……得到……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "651964cc8053dc84ab52fbb2cd9cb1182ca30d0ed4955c9e5ed2e5808b6e0644", "ja": "……みんなに、私が……。", "zh": "……大家，由我来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1020_null", "source_sha256": "f98711cb04070079f6a75522ec1c6d8f6ae32a6d8f061af2195d5a37cfd1eaa8", "ja": "ガヤガヤ……", "zh": "（人声鼎沸）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "32c28fd84a782a5bced829e2f56448974a406f32326d6534e384751d8d0e9026", "ja": "おっ、外が慌ただしいな。\nスタッフが動き出してるから、雨が止んだのかも。", "zh": "哦，外面好像忙起来了。\n工作人员开始行动了，说不定雨已经停了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1022_045kar", "source_sha256": "00fc7df185f0272358c3b29059eec80040ca92321361d560d70024fc5762c0c5", "ja": "……っ！\nさ、撮影、準備しなきゃ……！", "zh": "……！\n得、得去准备拍摄了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "919f365e878aca0d71fd57dfacbe3c475f6ba1bde8a4dfe407a0474123079f8e", "ja": "……いけそうか？", "zh": "……能撑得住吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1024_045kar", "source_sha256": "1703933497d2ad979f5873218e2afc5a4304ad8825bbe6de023cdf2da0734b72", "ja": "は、はい……。も、もしかしたら、私も少しは、\n役に立ててるのかもって……思ったら……。", "zh": "是、是的……如果想想，说不定我也能派上一点用场……就……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1025_045kar", "source_sha256": "5a55f799ba2205c6ddb6b58b2d89864b70145a27295b781b50c916d62c6163e8", "ja": "ほ、本当に……\n勇気が、湧いてきました……。えへへ♪", "zh": "真、真的……勇气涌上来了……。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1026_401pro", "source_sha256": "b6fc9e5efcf8db664cc4a7c6cd205b14ede002a686517c829e346e422a19c4ee", "ja": "……そっか！\nよし、その調子で一番手、頼んだぞ！", "zh": "……这样啊！\n好，就保持这个状态，拜托你第一个上场了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0306_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_04_1027_045kar", "source_sha256": "2f836c54962e6ff179f22ce669d0ba5043e3a9a068a7add868c2cca98ecde2f2", "ja": "は、はい……、あの……。\nいってきます……！", "zh": "好、好的……那个……\n我出发了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
